Vim-mode nav rework + jump-to-media.

Final keymap (vim NORMAL mode):
  j / k         chat line up/down (unchanged)
  Shift+J / K   jump message-by-message in chat (NEW)
  Up / Down     tree (sidebar) navigation (was Shift+J / K)
  ]m / [m       jump to next/prev message containing media (NEW)
  Space         enter selected channel (unchanged)

Media def: any message with embeds or stickers (covers attachments,
gifs, images, video, link previews, custom stickers).

Adds 4 new actions (50–53), no upstream codes touched. Off-screen
fetching is intentionally out of scope: walks only the currently
loaded messages list. Reaching the end shows
"No more media in this direction." in the extra line.

